		"description": "<p>While many artificers are content to remain far from the front lines of any war, tinkering away in their labs to create new arms and armors for their distant allies, not all have that choice. Some must defend their work, or their home, more directly. Warmakers use mystical techniques and craft solutions much as any artificer might, but have learned that sometimes a direct application of percussive maintenance is the best solution for the many problems that rise up in the world.</p><p><strong>Table: Warmaker</strong></p><table border=\"1\"><colgroup><col><col></colgroup><thead><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>Level</td><td>Features</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>3rd</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.I7DrOtu4gbJXjZZV]{Armored Artifice} @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.ampMQv1IDzgvblFm]{Treatise: Combat Techniques} @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.NcQ7nT4psn3ZdjZh]{Treatise: Legends and Lore}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>5th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.awlsNMNUQO08zEZo]{Tactical Combatant}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>9th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.5mymD8ezY0IvNp9z]{Weapons Expert}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>15th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.PSC1C9f1o9zOfzRQ]{Warmaker’s Reserve}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
